@Service
class CartService {
    private final CartRepository repo;          // injected singleton, immutable
    private final DiscountEngine discountEngine; // injected singleton
    CartService(CartRepository repo, DiscountEngine discountEngine) {
        this.repo = repo; this.discountEngine = discountEngine;
    }

    // No mutable fields: per-request data is a method parameter / local var.
    Cart applyDiscount(Long cartId) {
        var cart = repo.findById(cartId).orElseThrow(() -> new CartNotFoundException(cartId));
        cart.applyDiscount(discountEngine.bestFor(cart));
        return repo.save(cart);
    }
}
// Request-specific IDs are no longer shared; collaborators still need suitable concurrency behavior.
```

*Method-local variables are not shared between calls, but objects they reference may still be shared; shared mutable state needs a concurrency design.*

